//! Zilog Z80 CPU
//!
//! The Zilog Z80 is an 8-bit CPU. The CPU extends the Intel 8080 instruction
//! set. The Sharp LR35902 is a Z80 variant used in the Nintendo Game Boy
//! and Game Boy Color.

